# Verification required

Before claiming success: IDENTIFY → RUN → READ → VERIFY ([debug/reference.md](../../ai-skills/debug/reference.md) § Close-out verification gate).

State expected outcome · run/describe verification · note what was **not** run · regression risks · callee grep if call targets changed ([`callee-redirect-cleanup`](../patching/callee-redirect-cleanup.mdc)).

Forbidden without fresh run: "should work", "looks correct", "done". If cannot verify, say so explicitly.
